*> PLB-C036 arithmetic-overflow: the receiver of ADD, SUBTRACT, or
*> MULTIPLY has fewer integer digits than an operand, and there is no
*> ON SIZE ERROR.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ARITH.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  BIG-AMOUNT          PIC S9(9)V99 VALUE 0.
01  SMALL-TOTAL         PIC S9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
01  WIDE-TOTAL          PIC S9(11)V99 VALUE 0.
01  COUNTER             PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01  RATE                PIC 9V999 VALUE 0.
01  EDITED-TOTAL        PIC ZZZ9.99.
01  TABLE-AREA.
    05  ROW-TOTAL       PIC 9(3) OCCURS 10 TIMES.
01  IX                  PIC 9(9) VALUE 1.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ADD BIG-AMOUNT TO SMALL-TOTAL
    ADD BIG-AMOUNT TO WIDE-TOTAL
    ADD 1 TO COUNTER
    ADD 12345 TO COUNTER
    SUBTRACT BIG-AMOUNT FROM SMALL-TOTAL
    MULTIPLY BIG-AMOUNT BY RATE GIVING SMALL-TOTAL ROUNDED
    MULTIPLY RATE BY SMALL-TOTAL
    ADD BIG-AMOUNT SMALL-TOTAL GIVING EDITED-TOTAL
    ADD BIG-AMOUNT TO SMALL-TOTAL
        ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "TOO BIG"
    END-ADD
    ADD 1 TO ROW-TOTAL(IX)
    ADD COUNTER TO ROW-TOTAL(IX)
    ADD BIG-AMOUNT TO ROW-TOTAL(IX)
    STOP RUN.
